From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x: Load the
 Purwa video firmware

The IdeaPad Slim 5x 14Q8X9 is a Purwa machine, whose Iris core runs a
firmware of its own: Iris binds qcom,x1p42100-iris with one video
pipe, against four on Hamoa. Lenovo's graphics driver ships both
images, qcvss8380.mbn for Hamoa and qcvss8380_pa.mbn for Purwa, and
the tree asked for the Hamoa one. Load qcvss8380_pa.mbn, the image
the Acer Aspire 16 AI, another Purwa machine, decodes H.264 and HEVC
with.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x.dtsi
index 1f9e048..16f1b73 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-lenovo-ideapad-slim5x.dtsi
@@ -1018,7 +1018,7 @@
 };
 
 &iris {
-	firmware-name = "qcom/x1p42100/LENOVO/83HL/qcvss8380.mbn";
+	firmware-name = "qcom/x1p42100/LENOVO/83HL/qcvss8380_pa.mbn";
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
